{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "84317ada031c46bd8894144cb4441356279a967e0ac92ba5dcf48cb09f9315a4", "ja": "レッスンに来ないアイドル達を探しに行った\nプロデューサーは、奇妙な機械を被って眠る\n一同を発見。丁度やって来た律子達に話を聞\nくと、いつの間にか倉庫にあった謎のゲーム\n機らしい……訝しむプロデューサー。", "zh": "制作人去寻找没来上课的偶像们时，发现大家都戴着奇怪的机器睡着了。向正好赶来的律子等人询问后得知，那似乎是不知何时出现在仓库里的神秘游戏机……制作人对此深感疑惑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "759806a1485a97c6fd32120ffccb86a7adb098debcd25e0d6cabe158959bbf52", "ja": "（瑞希たちのレッスンを見学する予定だったのに、\n誰もいなかった……どこに行ったんだろう？）", "zh": "（本来打算去参观瑞希她们的训练，结果一个人都没有……她们去哪儿了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f991c4bf3ce84c7610481878bc48c435fc2c29076bb5be233f1fd72a8a547e8d", "ja": "（全員無断でサボったのか？\nうーん、何か奇妙だぞ……琴葉もいるのに）", "zh": "（难道所有人都没请假就翘课了吗？\n嗯……总觉得有点奇怪啊……明明琴叶也在）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "0b69d9d6ac35c28fb83e91db9341c665f48df6d3366e828e0a5ba24e9f4938cb", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんだ！\nお疲れさまでーす。どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "啊，原来是{$P$}先生！\n辛苦啦。怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f718205fbb6782fabdb201674b5b42fe7303d11e19489c3e5b628f77a6999425", "ja": "未来か、お疲れさま。それが、ええと……。\n瑞希たちが居ないんだけど、どこかで見てないか？", "zh": "是未来啊，辛苦了。那个，呃……\n瑞希她们不在，你有没有在哪里见过她们？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "d379dbc73b316a7b65abd3a1c03356d5658474a698a6f7ccd13c58204bc95bbb", "ja": "瑞希ちゃんですか？　うーん、うーん……。\nあっ！　もしかして……あそこかも？", "zh": "是瑞希吗？嗯——嗯……  \n啊！该不会……在那边吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "0a935193c9e1bc8aa73a782ad61b1fed668fd11506a8761c1deecfd7b4b9af98", "ja": "…………ムニャ。", "zh": "…………唔喵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "de616468cee4873482ff21d50fcf66a111e27c9cfb707888e16aecf102cace4b", "ja": "うわっ、瑞希！？　ジュリアも琴葉も、翼も星梨花も！\nみんな……えっと……。ね、寝てるのか？", "zh": "哇，瑞希！？还有茱莉亚、琴叶、翼和星梨花！  \n大家……呃……难、难道都睡着了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0ceb0064562f7e5e285be6f4cb6ef4e64d4900019a349ab0c46f064fbe205f90", "ja": "しかも全員顔に何か機械をつけて……何なんだ？\n新しい目のマッサージ器か？", "zh": "而且每个人脸上都戴着什么机器……这是怎么回事？\n新型眼部按摩器吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "ab2d9fa52bb7c841b446f6d70f867bf2080fbb474e9d0b5b363ba419937a1420", "ja": "それ、倉庫でこぶんが見つけたんです。すごいですよ！\nボタン押したら動いたんですけど、もう完全に別世界！", "zh": "那个，是小弟在仓库里发现的。很厉害哦！\n按下按钮就动起来了，然后就完全是另一个世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a51b652f193d43877f55386f718dd5fc4108da978fd020b45c448955aa8d9c6c", "ja": "こぶんって、環がここで飼ってる猫だよな？\nええと……動いたら別世界？", "zh": "小分是环在这里养的猫吧？\n呃……动起来就是另一个世界？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "66ea29ff0ae1172662ae46d922321c63d985e760b2f5189621e4acc3abe86c37", "ja": "ちょっと未来、それじゃ全然わからないでしょ。\n{$P$}、私たちから説明します。", "zh": "稍微有点未来，那样根本让人完全搞不懂吧。\n{$P$}，我们来说明一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "01c14b56ed9bb802668b06181bd2257eebee7622f8421d29c763c15fc09e5504", "ja": "律子！　それに茜と杏奈も……\nなんだ、どういう事なんだ？", "zh": "律子！还有茜和杏奈……到底是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3b4553ab4c44b15be8771050a504223fffda086e60a35771f67d9c719ada7fd5", "ja": "なるほど。つまりこれは、いつの間にか倉庫にあった、\n何だかものすごいVRゲーム機なんだな？", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，这是台不知不觉出现在仓库里的、特别厉害的VR游戏机吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "6a3af88a05fa8fe386439377629ec0c457edcccfb0e77b29be40c8f78d3a23d3", "ja": "です……みんなで、かわりばんこで遊んでて……。\n本当に、異世界に行ったみたい……♪", "zh": "是的……大家轮流玩……。\n真的就像去了异世界一样……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "a64a643082c6d9c6e064ed851380cc616f82591be20d9c01151482283c9ae64a", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんにも早く教えてあげよう\nと思ってたんだけどねー。タイミングがなくて！", "zh": "本来还想着早点告诉{$P$}的呢——只是一直没找到时机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "91aee9e068f8dc4142a88d547355956100b7980a70b4897051acec1909e9b0de", "ja": "あ、別に「取り上げられるかもしれないし、\nその前に遊んでおこう！」とか考えたんじゃないよ☆", "zh": "啊，我可不是在想“说不定会被收走，所以先玩个痛快吧！”之类的事哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "95c9dd784e6e2c41385c9ab366a0fae0f4e4f7f6fb266dfa4a108fa3dc2ae489", "ja": "そうか……まさか青羽さんと話してたことが\n現実になっていたとはな。いつの間に……。", "zh": "这样啊……没想到和青羽小姐聊过的事竟然成真了。不知不觉间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "49cb3ac2bc5cbf788e6e22a71492310d02a1df1f27da82c9aab4a303dcb8690e", "ja": "美咲ちゃんも遊んでますよ！　ちょいちょいってして、\nいっぱい衣装を作ってくれてます♪", "zh": "美咲姐也在玩哦！点一点，就帮我做了好多好多服装♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d5d90154fbfc6dbe396c38c81e53cba28ed9ad9163e8e7dbbfc244c31b83227b", "ja": "えっ、なぜ現実と同じことを……ん？\nさっきはそんなこと言ってなかったような……？", "zh": "诶，为什么会和现实中一样……嗯？\n刚才好像没说过这种话吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "1a400820e28932bba5cba572d0a4dd7e5c84abd8f9c9a56aa4ca34ff9b52aa19", "ja": "あはは、ごめんなさい。早く{$P$}に\n言わなきゃって、私も琴葉も思ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "啊哈哈，抱歉。  \n我和琴叶本来都想着得赶紧告诉{$P$}，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "bbd0aade4e698538efe83a5dcc76c1c2e7cd9de04c7444acd86090cc50d4aed4", "ja": "あまりにも凄いゲームなもので、\nつい夢中で調べたり……遊んだりしてましたっ！", "zh": "因为这游戏实在太厉害了，\n不知不觉就沉迷在调查……还有玩游戏里了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e7e56ba465706e4481ba9685af148acb8677f496edcdbe2978224bb129f1a1ab", "ja": "なるほどな、まあ……話はわかった。", "zh": "原来如此，不过……我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "97342c5543c7b72a8dd0651cd586244f0a0cd482fee086fd0f4681203e86951e", "ja": "このゲーム、本当にすごいんですよ！\n風景とかも360度、ぜーんぶ現実とおんなじで！", "zh": "这个游戏真的很厉害哦！连风景什么的，也都360度全方位地和现实一模一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "d2ad769f22b5f8612a819858210ca60165c48064287389cd4d474957c0f5a2fe", "ja": "杏奈も、こんなゲーム、初めて……。\n百合子さんも、ビックリ、してます……。", "zh": "安奈也是第一次见到这么厉害的游戏……\n百合子也惊讶得说不出话了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a8e525f7526dadba0096adc3f7d3ec3e7e74e7d39e09d1e864bd8574bc3c9649", "ja": "杏奈や百合子がそこまで言うなんて、よっぽど\n凄いんだな。しかし、いつの間にそんなゲームが……？", "zh": "连杏奈和百合子都这么说，那肯定特别厉害。不过，什么时候出现这种游戏的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "2b70e08dd606a5fc41aa8611c4d8c639fa646928f2e355cbf880e32a69645756", "ja": "まあ、息抜きになってるなら別にいいんだけど。\nこの寝たままの状態は、ちょっとなぁ。", "zh": "不过，要是能让她们放松一下，那倒也没什么。只是一直这么睡着不动，多少有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "25dd4ab5d29141b4194430df9ce21985d09400869ad57568661f561f214e47a0", "ja": "ハニャ？　そういえば、もう帰ってくるって言ってた\n時間すぎてるよね？　どうしたのかニャ？", "zh": "哈呀？说起来，已经过了说好要回来的时间了吧？这是怎么回事喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "39c429cb5666cb11a6c6d932c4caee8e6bbe22e387457e12df340fce0e08114e", "ja": "とにかく、瑞希たちを起こすか。\nこれは、ええと……このまま起こしても平気なのか？", "zh": "总之，先把瑞希她们叫醒吧。  \n不过，这个嘛……就这样叫醒她们，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1029_009rit", "source_sha256": "5414533994371090f385081253ac7f44d3a74f75cb13f7ff755881a1634cf562", "ja": "ええ、大丈夫ですよ。一定以上の衝撃があると、\n自動でログアウトするんです。", "zh": "嗯，没问题。一旦受到一定程度以上的冲击，就会自动退出登录。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "de47faf5c594c853f6289b0c0fe142b16ca6a88a442a80a4db841d2da9a6e27e", "ja": "そうか、よし……。", "zh": "这样啊，好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_1031", "source_sha256": "b0e94e5d91fc8699a77df208e1b4aff9d401ffb03e5bb883c3c3b94da88a0dfb", "ja": "起こす", "zh": "叫醒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_2000_p", "source_sha256": "7950fad21c550a2bf6882f97f5f357e366438c57493bf28f1c54910aff7ca708", "ja": "おーい、瑞希、ジュリア？　おーい……。", "zh": "喂，瑞希，茱莉亚？喂——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_2002_009rit", "source_sha256": "dc130b6484e45ca67a59b9af005f9c79b2f80268263b6db017da6ace21c9f7c5", "ja": "あら？　変ですね……いつもなら、これだけ\n揺すったら起きるんですけど……ちょっと、琴葉？", "zh": "哎呀？奇怪了……要是平时，摇成这样\n早就该醒了……等等，琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_2003_014mir", "source_sha256": "bf079b339d1732db9d707b45ec20cee0c8c8500a2faf8dbb9262484a07aa1a46", "ja": "翼、星梨花～、おやつの時間だよ～。\n生クリームいっぱいだよ～。お茶も淹れるよ～！", "zh": "翼、星梨花——，吃点心的时间到了哦——。有好多好多鲜奶油哦——。我也来泡茶哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_2004_023aka", "source_sha256": "30d971f88e3c17ad648786fad381fa7641570a8d676d87caa82875f3b0341f12", "ja": "みんなダメみたい……。あれ？　どゆこと？", "zh": "大家好像都不行了……。咦？这是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_02_2005_024ann", "source_sha256": "422c8d3601d6cb2c0a043ee1ade41dfec2426b87651306b7e3947e8bd2d54701", "ja": "んと……この機械、もうひとつ、あるから……。\n杏奈、呼びに行く……？", "zh": "嗯……这台机器，还有一台……\n要杏奈，去叫人吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
